# BUILD A COMPLETE MODERN RESPONSIVE WEB APPLICATION — "SKILL LEARNER"

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, modern, responsive, mobile-first web application named **Skill Learner**.

Brand tagline: **Teach. Learn. Connect. Grow.**

Skill Learner is a community-based skill-sharing platform where people can discover skills, teach what they know, learn from others, connect with like-minded people, exchange knowledge, track their learning progress, and showcase verified achievements.

The platform must be a real, functional web application, not just a static UI design or landing page.

The design must be professional, visually attractive, accessible, scalable, secure, and suitable for real-world use.

## 2. CORE OBJECTIVES

The application must allow users to:

- Create an account and securely sign in.
- Create and customize their personal profiles.
- Add skills they can teach.
- Select skills they want to learn.
- Discover people based on skills, interests, and location preferences.
- Send and manage skill-exchange requests.
- Connect with other learners and teachers.
- Track learning progress.
- Earn achievements and badges based on actual completed activities.
- Join community learning activities.
- Receive notifications about important events.
- Manage their dashboard, profile, privacy, and account settings.

Make the experience beginner-friendly so that even someone who has never used a skill-sharing platform can understand it.

