## 11. SKILL EXCHANGE SYSTEM

This is one of the most important features of Skill Learner.

Allow a user to request a skill exchange with another user.

Each exchange request should include:
- Requesting user.
- Receiving user.
- Skill offered.
- Skill requested.
- Optional introductory message.
- Creation timestamp.
- Current status.

Support these statuses:
- Pending
- Accepted
- Declined
- Cancelled
- Completed

Users should be able to:
- Send requests.
- View sent requests.
- View received requests.
- Accept or decline requests.
- Cancel their own pending requests.
- View accepted exchanges.
- Mark an exchange as completed through a suitable completion workflow.

Validate all status transitions.

Only authorized participants should be able to access or update an exchange.

Prevent duplicate or invalid requests where appropriate.

Do not automatically mark an exchange as completed without a valid user action or configured verification process.

